Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ARM: at91: remove at91sam9261/at91sam9g10 legacy board support
Date: Fri, 21 Nov 2014 12:27:08 +0100
Message-ID: <2e591e7b3ac20c8f686a6099d236d09964d08406.1416568804.git.nicolas.ferre@atmel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.1.3
